  "articleBody": "A successful room addition starts with a clear use, accurate property information, and a provider who can coordinate design, structural planning, permits, construction, and inspections. In San Diego County, the right plan also depends on the property’s jurisdiction, setbacks, utilities, existing foundation, energy requirements, and whether coastal or neighborhood-specific review applies.",
